{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"58fe88bd5b9ad8e34fde0a4482e0a236d011c18ba347bf26cef9284639865176","ja":"志保、怒髪天！？","zh":"志保，怒发冲冠！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"146a74578e09589ddfe720223757187bae6d68f7651117dc3b8ded9c48f295d6","ja":"ふたりとも、お疲れ様です。","zh":"两位都辛苦了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2d89be1cbff92ec4a4ee08e116205493558d1e6e31964c7d00c067d99c6a23e8","ja":"あれ？　意外と怒ってない？\nそれとも……実は心の中でメラメラモード！？","zh":"咦？意外地没有生气？\n还是说……其实内心正处于怒火中烧模式！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b1816e2b4c13007c9df4fcd8b8a083b3a01226cade335b003eb49032b25a3f48","ja":"それって一番怖いやつじゃん！\nご、ごめんなさ～～～～いっ、志保！","zh":"那不是最吓人的那种吗！\n对、对不起来～～～～，志保！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b0c3ab2d42eaf772535e5e9192746ee0ee1926cc213059d50691fd952c15aa6f","ja":"本っ当～にすいませんでしたっ！　と～っても\n反省してるので、解雇だけはなにとぞ～！","zh":"真～的非常对不起！我非～常\n在反省了，求求您千万别解雇我～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d93887887f8693542603053931ec7ce585104a7c2609ad68bb0615a2b5a554c1","ja":"え……？\nねぇ、エミリー。このふたり、どうしたの？","zh":"诶……？\n呐，艾米莉。这两个人是怎么了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b66561cdf928122df7a951cda9cd70d204cea2bf6207bfd35ba5ec6519704493","ja":"ええと……お稽古の遅刻を、志保さんがとても\n怒っていらっしゃるのではないかと心配していて……。","zh":"那个……因为担心排练迟到这件事，\n志保小姐是不是非常生气……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4dc5274eafc7b46edaf95e8ecf7e14882b3104470d6a7e0cd54aefa2fe675bbe","ja":"ふ～ん……。\nどうしてそう思うんです？","zh":"哼～嗯……\n为什么会这么觉得呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"10a1b6c37091e3980b19c3c5ba8c123818b9fee5e6c93833186d7cf6d5ecd80f","ja":"だ、だって！　同じメッセージ何回も\n送ってきたじゃ～～～ん！","zh":"可、可是！你明明把同一条消息\n发了好多遍嘛～～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"aa1703ffee52e9b550e44f68875f8efc4585078de2b2e6394d7fd0d535ca4cf7","ja":"だからオレたち、も～すっげー焦って！\n返事もなんて書いたらいいかわかんなくて！","zh":"所以我们，真是超级着急！\n连回信该怎么写都不知道了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"73627841fb0f7f31718d073e47f7d7be2616600997da60e8005bba2e57a9ea1b","ja":"メッセージ……？　あっ。\n本当だ、何回も送っちゃってる。","zh":"留言……？啊。\n真的耶，我不小心发了好多条。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"d59d88d899406a7d4cf82c5ae60a852d9a86f8af05fb16e51b921d2bc0336c55","ja":"えっ？　わざとじゃないのか？","zh":"诶？不是故意的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"61a921bc8a09187bc55d4d8f2eef01f93c3e5016417f80ddd95f365d52f418d4","ja":"はい。誤作動ですね、すみません。","zh":"好的。是误操作呢，不好意思。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"82cb124e8f593f89de53a0545ebb6b70f5502e08ff910745d89a2fc3eebb0719","ja":"で、でも亜美たちを怒ってるのはホントだよね！？\nだって兄ちゃんに報告しに……！","zh":"可、可是你在生亚美她们的气是真的吧！？\n毕竟你还要去向大哥报告……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"cd19db7aab4c1876bfe379aa6259e38a0a9e246ba3694654d2651131837d1aa8","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーさんとは、\n次のお仕事の話をしてきただけだけど……？","zh":"我和●●●●制作人，\n只是聊了聊下一份工作的事而已哦……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"fb7f132a5aece35e68a8eeb53ad013058383b4c2e8c773f8cc817b3a990f4c52","ja":"えっ、そゆこと！？\n……な～んだ！　怖がってソンした～。","zh":"诶，是这么回事吗！？\n……搞什么嘛！害我白害怕一场～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"bbeeefa03181d91850449f43266aa6ad3208f01a3832f8f1968855b213799b0d","ja":"そんなに安心するくらい、\n焦ってたんだ……。","zh":"都放心成这样了，\n是有多着急啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"0f3295ede1741a2d8198bbbfe43a066a0c2df71a2df713ecb1a2a3e2f3663a75","ja":"じゃあ本当に遅れてほしくないときは、\nまたこの方法を使えばいいのかな？　ふふっ♪","zh":"那真正不想迟到的时候，\n只要再用这个方法就行了吗？呵呵♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"947da0e4238157ce796a119969a073cfbdd9dab8046a96b603b553be45807fb2","ja":"ええ～っ！？　待って待って！\nそれはナッシングの方向で！","zh":"诶诶～！？等等等等！\n那个还是算了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1079.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"1851c4b0e5490d6c0e5db1763b9d79de3e4c013c2e62f66ad0141fe581827755","ja":"そ、そうだよ！\n心臓に悪すぎるって～～～！","zh":"就、就是说啊！\n对心脏太不好了啦～～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
